// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DoctorConversation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P118739643" "Physician conversation"
// DetailString :
"P1614446720" "One of the doctors you rescued told you:<br><br>'You know, people warned me about this city when I came here for the conference, but I never believed them. Thank you for saving me! I have to tell you, I think they were after me in particular. They kept asking me about the new drug I've been testing; it reduces the likelihood of the body rejecting an organ transplant. I hope this information helps."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
