// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1065441654" "Tattered map"
// DetailString :
"P3846435413" "This map is worn, but it looks like it might show a portion of the Paragon City sewers. It will require expert analysis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
