// Task - StoryArc_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1502198381" "Vahzilok's zombies attacked a conference over at the hospital a few hours ago and kidnapped several of the attending physicians. One of the hostages managed to get a call out on his cell phone. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to rescue those physicians from the Vahzilok.</A> I have grave fears about this, {HeroName}. The office raid, the chemical hijacking, and now this attack on the hospital. It's clear that the Vahzilok are up to no good."
// AcceptString :
"P3380622931" "Rescue the physicians from the Vahzilok"
// SendOffString :
"P896664194" "Make certain none of the hostages are harmed."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1160683140" "Rescue the physicians"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1275657536" "You haven't rescued those doctors from the Vahzilok."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P581026795" "Notes from the conference are scattered here and there, marked by the dark, odorous footprints of the undead."

