"P4064016364" "You found a tattered map."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3565105259" "One of the Vahzilok dropped this map? Looks like it might show part of the sewer system. If I'm right, and the Vahzilok are trying to drug the water supply, you may have just found the clue we need to turn their plan on ear."
// RandomFameString :
"P1826379938" "{HeroName} has done a lot to keep the streets clear of those Cadavers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3986538514" "We need to have this map examined by an expert."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - StoryArc_Errand5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3228102290" "I'll bet anything this map you found has something to do with the Vahzilok's plan to drug the water supply. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to take the map to the city representative.</A> She can tell us exactly what part of the sewer it references."
// AcceptString :
"P1525191842" "Take the map to the city representative"
// SendOffString :
"P4032425730" "Watch your back. The Vahzilok may be aware you found this."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1209418035" "Take map to city representative"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1155189996" "You really need to get that map to the city representative."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2210907384" "Mussst...ssstop..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1550762499" "Hmm, yes, you took this map off a Vahzilok you say? I'll get this to someone in the city planner's office at once."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1183765289" "I'm glad you're back. I just heard from the city planner's office. That map marks the location of the purification system. I'm right, {HeroName}, I know I am! The Vahzilok plan to drug all of Paragon City's water!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4253490575" "I think the purifiers would eliminate this drug, <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>so {BOSS_NAME} must plan to bypass them in order to introduce the drug to the system.</A>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - StoryArc_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P837288837" "According to the city planner, this map you found marks the location of the water purification system over in Kings Row. If {BOSS_NAME} manages to introduce his drug to the water there, it'll be bad news for everyone with a faucet. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>{HeroName}, you've got to stop {BOSS_NAME} from drugging the water.</A> If you hurry, lives can still be saved."
// AcceptString :
"P1604589675" "Stop {BOSS_NAME} from drugging the water"
// SendOffString :
"P1160937257" "The Vahzilok will have their drug stored at several strategic positions. You need to destroy it before they can release it into the water system."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4041860548" "Defeat {BOSS_NAME} and crew"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2094773566" "You haven't stopped the Vahzilok from drugging the water supply? It may be too late by now!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4078894110" "Right now, families are washing dishes and bathing children, unaware that you are the only thing standing between their water and the Vahzilok's strange drug."

