// Dialog :
"P3606024235" "You destroyed those chemicals just in time!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1314677230" "Well, we stopped them. If I'm, right, {HeroName}, that Vahzilok drug would have impaired the immune system of every person in this city. It would have been easier for Vahzilok to transform people into zombies, since his victims would have a much lower chance of rejecting the tissue grafts.<br><br>It also would have made us less likely to fight off infections and viruses. Before long, the hospital wards would be full of people dying from flu or the common cold! Thank you so much, {HeroName}; you've done this city a great service."
// RandomFameString :
"P1476540591" "I saw on the news that {HeroName} saved us all from a Vahzilok plot!"
